 to  this was the tiber family itself  which maintained possession of the  warhammer titan and was granted the  status of  honorary marlan aristocrats so unlike  the rest of the aldian population on the  continent  the tibers were allowed to live in  lavish mansions outside of the  internment zones  and they were not required to submit to  oppressive measures such as being forced  to wear armbands that publicly  identified them as  aldians the tiber family is first  introduced in the story  after the time skip when zeke yeager  convinces the tibers to come out and  publicly support the next invasion of  parodies  island because the tibers are celebrated  in marley for having  sided with the marlians against their  fellow eldians  zeke was hoping that public support from  the tibers would soften marland public  opinion  about the other aldeans on the continent  especially now that these other aldians  were preparing to sacrifice  their lives in order to take down the  so-called  island devils basically many aliens on  the continent  desperately want the marlenes to see  them as good aliens  they want to be seen as different from  the so-called bad aldeans  on the island however we quickly learned  that there is more to the tiber family  than meets the eye officially the  marlayan people believe that they played  a major role  in winning the great titan war and  overthrowing the aldean empire  specifically a legendary marlene hero  called hellos  is believed to be the one who defeated  the earth devil and saved the world  from the aldian devils but according to  willie tiber the head of the tiber  family  that was all a lie and hellos  may never have even existed instead the  aldean empire was brought down by the  alliance of carl fritz and the tiber  family and the story of hellos was just  invented as a way to make the marlins  think that they are the ones who are  in control it is heavily implied that  the tiber family  is secretly playing a major role in  ruling t