ile hardening power makes  it an incredibly useful titan shifter  especially in battle its ability to be  remotely controlled while the user is  safely sealed away  inside a crystal is also a major  advantage  and if it wasn't for aaron's play of the  game decision to use porco's jaw titan  as a nutcracker  willie tiber's sister would probably  still be the warhammer titans holder  luckily for aaron the warhammer titan's  abilities were able to combine  very nicely with the abilities of his  attack  titan and as a result aaron was able to  become extremely powerful  in his titan form after he managed to  gain the warhammer  titan and now let me know what you guys  think do you like  the warhammer titan and are you a fan of  its unique  powers and abilities where does this  titan shifter rank  in terms of your favorite titan shifter  powers  and in what other ways do you expect  that aaron is going to use this power  before the story  ends don't forget to leave your feedback  down in the comments below  if you enjoyed this video and you want  to see more attack on time videos right  here on the channel  please leave a like to let me know it  really does help and if you're new to  anime opera  or maybe you just haven't subscribed yet  make this the video that you subscribe  and hit that notification bell to turn  on all  notifications you really have to go  through the trouble of hitting that bell  and then selecting the option that says  all if you don't do that you're still  gonna miss a ton of our videos even if  you are subscribed  it's just how youtube works you can also  hit me up on twitter  and instagram at anime uproar  a big thank you to all of our anime  uproar patrons for making videos like  this one possible  special thank you to alpha sigma  disciple of lord twego himself  and i can't forget all of our the one  tier patrons the ones who stand above  all other clans including ingrata the  world acquired respect liam thompson  pate hepha rathee and yx  pho